    "scenesThatPass": [
      "RODMILLA: I will do what I can. Ladies, say hello to your new step-sisterz.\nMARGUERITE/ JACQUELINE: Mademoiselle.",
      "CELESTE: Honestly, Rodmilla, a young lady’s reputation does not belong in an alleyway.\nRODMILLA: Alright, I'll confess, I was bargain shopping for my chambermaids.",
      "DANIELLE: I really must go.\nRODMILLA: Paulette, where are the candlesticks? We can hardly see our plates. . PAULETTE | They are missing, mylady. I have searched high and low. . M…",
      "QUEEN MARIE: Never have I seen such a sea of bosoms in all my life.\nRODMILLA: Make haste, Marguerite, it’s now or never.\nQUEEN MARIE: My goodness, I do not even remember putting it on. Thank you, child. I must say, it is a rare person indeed who would return such a priceles…\nMARGUERITE: You are too...magnanimous, Majesty.",
      "RODMILLA: Where were you?\nDANIELLE: “I got lost.\nRODMILLA: I don’t believe it. You are hiding something from me -- I can feel it -- and I demand to know what it is.\nDANIELLE: Then, please, tell me so that I might go back to sleep."
    ]
